    <title>013｜年终灵魂十问：我们如何真正关心自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69506f142db086f8974e1195</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69506f142db086f8974e1195</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是一场发生在岁末的温暖对谈，我们通过十个问题，开启了一场真诚的自我对谈。这不仅是复盘，更是一次“如何真正关心自己”的探索。我们从欣赏自己开始，路过内心的脆弱与骄傲，最终学习如何温柔地接纳这个并不完美但真实独特的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝收听愉快～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✏️ Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 用一场真诚的对话，来关心这一年的自己</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 关怀起点：我欣赏自己的哪一部分？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">02:16</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 直面软肋：深入“无法容忍”，什么会真正刺痛我？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 人生策略：“打好手中牌”还是“随时换牌桌”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 内心戏码：“心猿意马”需要被审判吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 回溯温暖：童年哪个画面仍在滋养我？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 感谢决定：哪一步选择成就了今天的我？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 治愈时刻：如何真正奖励自己？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 停止内耗：我现在最应该放下什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 守护能量：什么样的关系值得投入？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a></span></strong></a><strong><span> 爱的能力：“给予者”还是“索取者”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 本期BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《La Campanella》- Iwamizu</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👧 主播信息：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>意义：</span></strong><span>相信真正的“人间清醒”，始于坦然无惧地面对并接纳真实的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小可：</span></strong><span>认为“自我关怀”不是感性的口号，而是理性地为自己的身心需求设立边界。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📻 收听方式：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客 | 小宇宙 | 网易云音乐 | 喜马拉雅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📌 加入对谈：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这不止是我们的对谈，也希望能启发你的自我对话。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>回顾：​ </span></strong><span>十个问题中，哪一个让你最有倾诉的冲动？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>发现：​</span></strong><span> 通过这次对话，你对自己有了什么新的发现？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>行动：</span></strong><span>​ 新的一年，你打算将“关心自己”落实为一个怎样的小行动？</span></p>]]></description>
